+# Performance history
+
+## SessionStart health gate
+
+The health-gate read path changed when `PRAGMA quick_check` was removed from
+`SessionStart`. In the same change, FTS coherence began using the
+trigger-maintained `meta.fts_rows` counter and the record-body length limit was
+enforced by the schema `CHECK` constraint rather than re-scanning record bodies.
+
+| Version | 5k-record `SessionStart` p50 |
+| --- | ---: |
+| Before the read-path change | No measured p50 could be found in this checkout or its recorded session history. |
+| After the read-path change | **0.907 ms** |
+
+The after figure was measured on 2026-09-14 with the repository benchmark,
+using 5,000 records, 15,000 cues, and 101 hook invocations in a release build
+(`muninn-bench perf --records 5000 --runs 101`). The unrounded measured p50 was
+0.906861 ms. This is a subprocess-level hook measurement. It should not be used
+to manufacture a before/after speedup while the before measurement is missing.
